id: hac-ahl7
title: Implement compact entity registry display discovery
description: "Add fully typed transport and CLI support for config/entity_registry/list_for_display, preserve raw compact keys by default, provide semantic decoded output, and support entity/domain/device/area/count/limit workflows across validated formats."
