acceptance_criteria: "Typed transport reflects every documented compact field without any or guessed external types; registries help, schema, filters, count, limit, raw compact and decoded outputs are tested in all supported formats; Actual built hassio command passes read-only structural live acceptance without recording entity data"
definition_of_ready: Official docs and live structural response agree on root keys and field union
goal: complete-agent-home-assistant-interface
objective: token-efficient-enabled-entity-discovery
value: Reduce Home Assistant registry payload and LLM token cost.
impact: Agents can discover enabled entity metadata without downloading private and disabled full registry records.
