close_reason: "Merged typed compact registry discovery in PR 69 at master d902dc0; 1,221 tests, 100/100/100/100 coverage, complete docs/help, and final read-only live built-binary acceptance passed."
body: "## Contract\\n\\nUse only the documented enabled-entity display endpoint. Preserve the raw compact contract for maximum token efficiency; decode into stable descriptive keys only when explicitly requested. Generic ws call remains the forward-compatible escape hatch."
